      "biography": "<p><em>Shoton Hijutsu (an Earthen Artifact).</em> It uses your highest jutsu attack bonus or Save DC when an effect calls for it. You command it as a Bonus action.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct, unaligned.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 16 + 2 for every rank above C-Rank, <strong>DR</strong> 4 +1 for every rank above C-Rank · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 30 + 15 for every rank above C-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 40 ft. STR +4 (save +8), DEX +2 (+6), CON +3 (+8), INT −5, WIS +0, CHA −5. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, All Sensory, Stunned, Petrified, Envenomed.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC, DR and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your highest jutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
